{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WQiJCUbp1wfcLwfVv3m6rd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan_001b_matched_ability_dif** (negative): 在每个 accuracy quintile 内部做 temporal cohort MH-DIF（控制能力后），enrichment 将从 plan_001 的 0.96 提升到 >1.5，证明能力匹配能隔离出污染信号。 ← 基于 plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n- **plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu** (negative): MH-DIF 在 METABENCH 真实 MMLU 数据（5227 模型 × 12508 items）上，用时间 cohort (2023 vs 2024) 和能力分位 cohort 分组时，ETS C 标记的 items 在 Li et al. clean items 中的 FPR ≤ 0.05，且 ETS C 标记在 contaminated items 中的比例显著高于 clean items。这验证 DIF 在真实数据上不会产生过多假阳性，且能捕捉到与 web-overlap 污染信号一致的差异性。 ← 基于 mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2\\\\n  [plan_001_analysis_script](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/plan_001_analysis.py) | [plan_001_report](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/report/plan_001_report.md) | [dif_results_temporal](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/dif_results_temporal.csv) | [dif_results_ability](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/dif_results_ability.csv) | [dif_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/dif_summary.csv) | [within_family_dif](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/within_family_dif.csv) | [cross_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu/data/cro