{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XZKSjFxMqiaBfJcY4WyXgX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 6\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP DIF 检测采用 ETS C 分类（效应量+显著性双阈值）替代 BH 校正 p 值作为主判定标准\\\\n  rationale: Monte Carlo 模拟显示 BH 校正在 200 items 场景下将 TPR 压缩 40-60%，所有核心条件均 FAIL/GRAY。但\\\\n    ETS C 分类（|Δ_MH|≥1.5 + 显著性，教育测量 gold standard）在 N≥80, δ≥1.4 时 TPR=0.72-0.85, FPR<0.05，满足\\\\n    pass criteria。ETS C 是 DIF 领域标准实践（Holland & Thayer 1988），使用效应量阈值比纯 p 值更稳健。操作点 N≥80,\\\\n    δ≥1.4 与 GSM1K 文档的重度污染效应量吻合。小效应由 ensemble 其他信号覆盖。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'BH-corrected: all FAIL/GRAY; ETS C: PASS at N≥80,δ≥1.4 (TPR=0.72-0.85,\\\\n      FPR<0.05)'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 19:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过：DIF+ETS C 在 N≥80,δ≥1.4 下功效达标，推荐 N≥100 为主操作点\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 合成参数 + Phase 2 真实参数（PSN-IRT）均验证 ETS C TPR≥0.65 at N≥80,δ≥1.4。Phase\\\\n    2 比 Phase 1 降低 3-6pp 符合预期。N=80,δ=1.4 裕度仅 0.032，推荐 N≥100 为主 claim。数据源为 PSN-IRT\\\\n    而非 ROADMAP 指定的 METABENCH，research 阶段需用 METABENCH 补充验证。限制：δ<1.0 需 ensemble 其他信号。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 1 conditional pass: ETS C TPR=0.72-0.85 at N≥80,δ≥1.4'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 2 pass: ETS C TPR=0.68-0.80 at N≥80,δ≥1.4 with real MMLU params'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 20:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream analysis (dream_20260520T194223): 6 confirmed actions from cross-tier\\\\n    synthesis, 2 new experiments added (plan_010/011), framing qualified'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream scores met thresholds (best=4/6, median=3.5/6, worst=3/6). Cross-tier\\\\n    analysis identified 6 confirmed issues (≥2 tiers): (1) contamination-capability\\\\n    confound → within-family analysis added to plan_001; (2) RL evidence underpowered\\\\n    → bootstrap CIs + equivalence testing added to plan_002; (3) partial exploitation\\\\n    gap → power analysis added to plan_002; (4) ground truth circularity → plan_011\\\\n    semi-synthetic validation added; (5) related work thin → Paper Agent writing-phase\\\\n    task; (6) Growing Pains differentiation → Paper Agent task. Additionally: plan_010\\\\n    architecture-stratified DIF added as P1 proactive defense from worst-case; novelty\\\\n    claim qualified from \\\\\\\"first self-healing benchmark\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"psychometric monitoring\\\\n    framework\\\\\\\". Re-dream required before P0 approval.'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 temporal cohort DIF 证伪（enrichment=0.96），根因是 impact vs DIF 混淆。批准\\\\n    matched-ability DIF 作为方法改进方向 1\\\\n  rationale: Temporal cohort MH-DIF 标记 31.3% items 为 ETS C，但 enrichment=0.96（clean\\\\n    和 contaminated 标记概率相同）—— DIF 检测的是系统性能力提升而非污染。Within-family (Llama-2 vs Llama-3)\\\\n    61.3% C 进一步证实。这是经典 impact vs DIF 混淆（Dream D2 预测过）。但 ability-quintile enrichment=1.19\\\\n    + FPR=2.7% 表明信号存在但弱。方向1 matched-ability temporal DIF 在 quintile 内做时间对比，是最快验证能力匹配能否放大信号的路径。方向2\\\\n    IRT equating 并行准备作为 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - temporal cohort enrichment 0.96, ability quintile enrichment\\\\n      1.19\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 方向 1 (matched-ability DIF) 失败确认，所有 quintile enrichment 0.94-1.04。plan_011\\\\n    是唯一决定性实验\\\\n  rationale: Quintile 内 temporal DIF 仍 enrichment≈1.0，ability matching 未能分离污染信号。但\\\\n    Reviewer 指出关键洞察：Li et al. web-overlap 是全局性污染（Common Crawl 对所有模型可用），不应产生 group-specific\\\\n    DIF。enrichment≈1.0 可能是 ground truth 不匹配而非方法失败。plan_011 注入的是已知差异性污染（仅 focal group），是唯一能区分\\\\\\\"DIF\\\\n    不 work\\\\\\\"和\\\\\\\"ground truth 不对\\\\\\\"的实验。方向 2 (IRT θ-matching) 如果问题出在 ground truth 也无法解决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001b_matched_ability_dif\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - all quintiles enrichment 0.94-1.04\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3783, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CcWrooXALYMoarrVRxYbPX","session_id":"9180ee7f-7e55-4fe5-bd4a-46db7023b8df","uuid":"0d0d0914-ebfe-463a-b705-963fddac493f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:40:20.832Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UcwaZzw8QKmmbAnHv6Cj5H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JgrVBTseApJCBmtC69VAx3","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"irt_equated_bench_regen","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3511,"cache_read_input_tokens":18298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3511,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CcWrooXALYMoarrVRxYbPX","session_id":"9180ee7f-7e55-4fe5-bd4a-46db7023b8df","uuid":"2e35c433-5f0d-4c9f-ab47-b52156fe2080"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JgrVBTseApJCBmtC69VAx3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## MVP 验证关键经验 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### D001 决策：ETS C 分类 > p-value 检验\\\\n- **p-value based DIF 检测在 200-item benchmark 上严重 underpowered**：BH 校正后 TPR 仅 0.04-0.07（N=50, δ=1.0）。即使 raw（不校正）TPR 也只有 0.36-0.39，远低于 0.70 目标\\\\n- **ETS C 分类（|Δ_MH|≥1.5 + 显著性）是可行的替代**：TPR=0.68-0.85 at N≥80, δ≥1.4。本质是 magnitude-based detection，绕过了多重检验问题\\\\n- **AUC 一直很好（0.91-0.96）**：说明 DIF 统计量的区分能力没问题，问题在假设检验的 threshold，不在信号本身\\\\n- **原因**：200 个 items 做 BH 校正，需要极小的 p-value 才能过。N=50-100 per group 对 MH/LR 的 per-item 统计功效不够产生 p<0.001 级别的 evidence\\\\n\\\\n### Phase 2 验证：真实参数稳健\\\\n- **PSN-IRT 真实 MMLU 参数** vs 合成参数差异显著：b_mean=-0.84（真实）vs 0.0（合成），即真实 MMLU items 偏容易\\\\n- 尽管参数分布差异大，ETS C TPR 在真实参数下反而更高（N=100, δ=1.6: 0.80 vs Phase 1 的 0.85）——差异不大，结论稳健\\\\n- **Phase 2 用了 PSN-IRT 而非 METABENCH**：PSN-IRT 的 item_parameters.csv 可直接使用（14042 items），无需下载 620MB 大包\\\\n\\\\n### 关键操作参数\\\\n- N≥80/group 是最低要求，N≥100 显著改善功效\\\\n- δ≥1.4 logits 是可靠检测区间，δ=1.0 在边界\\\\n- MH 5 层 quantile-based 分层 + ETS C 阈值是当前最佳组合\\\\n- LR 方法与 MH 表现相当，无显著优势\\\\n\\\\n## plan_001 关键教训 (2026-05-20) ⚠️\\\\n\\\\n### D003: 朴素 MH-DIF 无法区分污染与能力提升\\\\n- **Temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024)**: 31.3% ETS C，enrichment=0.96（clean 和 contaminated 被标记概率相同）\\\\n- **根因**：2024 模型整体比 2023 强，MH-DIF 捕获的是系统性能力差异，不是 item-level 污染信号\\\\n- **证据链**：\\\\n  - Within-family (Llama-2 vs Llama-3): 61.3% C — 代际能力差距 >> temporal cohort\\\\n  - Domain ρ(C_rate, Δacc)=0.307, p=0.02 — 准确率提升越大的 subject DIF 越高\\\\n  - 两种 cohort 的 C 类 items Jaccard 仅 0.014 — 两种 DIF 检测的完全不同的东西\\\\n  - Sanity check: 随机半分 0.18% C — MH 方法本身没问题\\\\n- **Ability cohort (Q1-2 vs Q4-5)**: 2.9% C, enrichment=1.19, FPR=2.7% — 弱正向信号但 enrichment 不够强\\\\n- **结论**：MH-DIF 必须在能力匹配的组间比较才有意义。不能直接用时间分组。需要 IRT equating 或 matched-ability 设计来控制能力混淆\\\\n\\\\n### 下一步方向（待 Director 决策）\\\\n1. **Matched-ability DIF**: 在同 accuracy quintile 内做时间 cohort DIF（控制能力后隔离污染信号）\\\\n2. **IRT equating**: 从响应矩阵拟合 2PL IRT，用 IRT equating 消除能力差异后做 DIF\\\\n3. **DPO/RL-specific DIF**: 用 RL-trained (477) vs non-RL 分组，控制能力后检测 training method 相关的 DIF\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 2 数据源调研 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### PSN-IRT (AAAI 2026)\\\\n- **论文全名**: \\\\\\\"Lost in Benchmarks? Rethinking Large Language Model Benchmarking with Item Response Theory\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/Joe-Hall-Lee/PSN-IRT\\\\n- MMLU 14,042 items, 仅 12 模型\\\\n\\\\n### METABENCH (Kipnis et al., ICLR 2025) ⭐ 推荐\\\\n- **论文全名**: \\\\\\\"metabench — A Sparse Benchmark of Reasoning and Knowledge in Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/adkipnis/metabench\\\\n- **Zenodo**: https://zenodo.org/records/12819251 (620MB)\\\\n- MMLU 12,508 items, 5,219 模型\\\\n\\\\n## METABENCH 数据探索关键发现 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ D002: preproc.rds 的 diff/disc 是 CTT 统计量，不是 IRT 参数\\\\n- **diff** = 0.75 × p_correct（猜测校正正确率），概率尺度 [0, 0.75]，**不是** IRT 的 b 参数\\\\n- **disc** = 点双列相关系数（rpbis），[-1, 1]，**不是** IRT 的 a 参数\\\\n- **CTT → IRT 不可直接转换**，必须从响应矩阵重新用 `mirt` 拟合\\\\n- METABENCH 的实际 IRT 拟合在 `crossvalidate.R` 中用 `mirt::mirt()` slope-intercept 参数化 (a1, d)\\\\n- 源码证据：`analysis/preprocess.R` lines 52-77\\\\n\\\\n### Cohort & RL 模型\\\\n- 2 个年度 cohort ≥80: 2023 (N=1,253), 2024 (N=658)\\\\n- 477 RL-labeled models: DPO(346), ORPO(52), PPO(11), KTO(6)\\\\n- 63% 模型无法从名称分类\\\\n\\\\n### Li et al. (EMNLP 2024) Proxy Ground Truth\\\\n- 9,229/12,508 items 有标注（73.8% 覆盖）\\\\n- clean 60.5% / input_and_label 33.0% / input_only 6.5%\\\\n- Web overlap proxy，非训练数据精确标签\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3099, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CcWrooXALYMoarrVRxYbPX","session_id":"9180ee7f-7e55-4fe5-bd4a-46db7023b8df","uuid":"674503d2-4199-4441-8b63-d987901b31ad","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:40:21.388Z"}
